  "description_short": "Family-run George café serving hearty breakfasts, fresh salads, and homemade comfort food since 2007.",
  "description_long": "Nina's Cafe has been a George institution since 2007, tucked into a charming spot on York Street in Dormehls Drift. This family-run establishment draws locals and visitors alike with its warm atmosphere and consistently good home-style cooking. The menu covers all the bases—generous breakfast platters that'll set you right for the day, fresh salads, satisfying burgers, and daily specials that showcase proper home cooking.\n\nThe café strikes that perfect balance between casual and welcoming, making it equally suited for a quick coffee and cake, a leisurely lunch with friends, or a family meal. Their baked goods are made in-house, and you'll often find regulars popping in just for their famous scones or a slice of something sweet. The service is friendly without being fussy, and the prices are fair—exactly what you want from a neighbourhood café.\n\nLocated in the heart of George, Nina's makes an ideal pit stop whether you're exploring the Garden Route or just need a reliable spot for a decent meal. With over a thousand positive reviews, they've clearly mastered the art of keeping it simple and doing it well.",
